      "start_seconds": 38.82,
      "end_seconds": 55.94,
      "duration_seconds": 17.12,
      "text": "maybe a six out of ten on a bad day i'd say a couple of times a week i get some relief from antihistamine and itchy eyes, too and sneezing fits, too"
