      "start_seconds": 116.53,
      "end_seconds": 127.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 36.7 degrees pulse is 67 beats a minute and blood pressure 114 over 71 saturation 98 percent respiratory rate 16."
