      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.29,
      "end_seconds": 285.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.59,
      "end_seconds": 289.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.11,
      "end_seconds": 293.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.67,
      "end_seconds": 302.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "So based on the history and the examination the most likely explanation is seasonal hay fever causing the cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.57,
      "end_seconds": 311.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.26,
      "end_seconds": 341.48,
      "duration_seconds": 28.22,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's seasonal hay fever causing the cough, and we'll watch how it goes i'm prescribing fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season it's for hay fever keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night one warning sign to remember: you start wheezing in that case don't wait"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.52,
      "end_seconds": 344.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.33,
      "end_seconds": 348.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "book a review in a month"
    },
